{"unit_id":"pedesdestiny__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","commit":"7f9205da1287c3945533af844c216fd296d7c975","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的浏览器桌面通知插件。它在浏览器端监听完整会话列表的状态变化，在会话从运行转为停止，或出现等待确认的交互时，调用浏览器 Notification API 通知用户。通知包括会话标题，可覆盖工具批准、计划审批和 Agent 提问；页面位于后台或相关会话未选中时才提示，点击通知会聚焦窗口，通知十秒后关闭。适合切到其他窗口等待长任务完成的 Web GUI 用户。使用前需保持 GUI 标签页打开并授予站点通知权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:53-83","client.js:31-45","client.js:85-97"]}
{"unit_id":"pedesdestiny__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","commit":"7f9205da1287c3945533af844c216fd296d7c975","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify adds desktop alerts to DSH Web. It watches sessions and notifies when one finishes or waits for input. Alerts show the session title, skip the selected session on a visible page, focus the browser when clicked, and close after ten seconds. Keep the GUI tab open and allow notifications.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:53-83","client.js:31-45","client.js:85-97"]}
