{"unit_id":"pedesdestiny__dsh-notify#feature-1","repo":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","commit":"7f9205da1287c3945533af844c216fd296d7c975","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的「会话完成提醒」：会话从运行状态停止时发送带会话标题的浏览器通知。监听会话列表状态变化；仅页面隐藏或该会话未选中时提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:64-74"]}
{"unit_id":"pedesdestiny__dsh-notify#feature-2","repo":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","commit":"7f9205da1287c3945533af844c216fd296d7c975","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的「等待交互提醒」：会话出现新的待处理交互时通知用户，覆盖批准、计划审阅和提问状态。通知包含会话标题，并遵循后台页面或非当前会话的提示门槛。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:23-27","client.js:76-81"]}
{"unit_id":"pedesdestiny__dsh-notify#feature-3","repo":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","commit":"7f9205da1287c3945533af844c216fd296d7c975","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的「点击通知返回会话」：点击浏览器通知会聚焦 DSH 窗口并关闭该通知；未点击的通知会在十秒后自动关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:36-42"]}
{"unit_id":"pedesdestiny__dsh-notify#caveat-1","repo":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","commit":"7f9205da1287c3945533af844c216fd296d7c975","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 使用浏览器 Notification API；DSH Web GUI 标签页必须保持打开，浏览器关闭时不会收到通知。首次加载的会话快照只作基线，不会补报加载前已结束的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:53-60","client.js:34-36"]}
